{%- comment -%}
  LUMORA PDP HOW TO USE (ritual position)  ·  lu-pdp-how-to.liquid  ·  v1.0
  Paste into: Long Light product template > Add section > Custom Liquid (padding 0), after Results.
  Where Long Light sits in the ritual: 01 Sunmelt, 02 Long Light (you are here), 03 Haze, then your
  daily SPF in the morning. Names link to their pages; prices are live. Scheme: Apricot wash.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign lu_a = all_products['sunmelt-cleansing-balm']
  assign lu_b = all_products['long-light-serum']
  assign lu_c = all_products['haze-soft-focus-cream']
-%}
<section class="lu-sec lu-s-apricot-wash lu-howto" id="how-to-use" aria-labelledby="lu-howto-title">
  <div class="container-fluid">
    <header class="lu-head">
      <p class="lu-eyebrow">How to use</p>
      <h2 id="lu-howto-title" class="lu-h2">After Sunmelt, before <em>Haze.</em></h2>
      <p class="lu-lead">Morning and evening, about a minute. Step 02 is the one that catches the light.</p>
    </header>
    <ol class="lu-howto__steps">
      <li>
        <span class="lu-howto__no"><svg class="lu-sunmark" viewBox="0 0 40 24" aria-hidden="true"><path class="a" d="M8 20a12 12 0 0 1 24 0"/><path class="h" d="M3 20h34"/><circle class="s" cx="8.6" cy="16.3" r="3"/></svg>01 · Cleanse</span>
        <h3><a href="{{ lu_a.url }}">Sunmelt</a></h3>
        <p>Massage the balm into dry skin, add a little water and it turns to milk. Rinse with warm water.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="is-here">
        <span class="lu-howto__no"><svg class="lu-sunmark" viewBox="0 0 40 24" aria-hidden="true"><path class="a" d="M8 20a12 12 0 0 1 24 0"/><path class="h" d="M3 20h34"/><circle class="s" cx="12.9" cy="10.3" r="3"/></svg>02 · Glow</span>
        <h3>Long Light <small>You are here</small></h3>
        <p>Two to three drops, pressed into face and neck while skin is still a little damp. It absorbs in seconds.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="lu-howto__no"><svg class="lu-sunmark" viewBox="0 0 40 24" aria-hidden="true"><path class="a" d="M8 20a12 12 0 0 1 24 0"/><path class="h" d="M3 20h34"/><circle class="s" cx="20" cy="8" r="3"/></svg>03 · Moisturize</span>
        <h3><a href="{{ lu_c.url }}">Haze</a></h3>
        <p>A pea-sized amount to seal it in, with a satin, soft-focus finish. Then, in the morning, your daily SPF.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="lu-howto__note">New to vitamin C? Patch-test on your inner arm for two evenings, then use Long Light every other day for the first week.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.lu-howto__steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.lu-howto__steps li{padding:28px 28px 30px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(251,246,239,.55);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--lu-hairline-strong)}
.lu-howto__steps li.is-here{background:var(--lu-linen);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--lu-hairline),var(--lu-shadow-lift)}
.lu-howto__no{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:600 12px/16px var(--lu-body);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgb(var(--color-price-sale))}
.lu-howto__no .lu-sunmark{color:var(--lu-dusk)}
.lu-howto__steps h3{margin:16px 0 0;font:400 26px/1.15 var(--lu-display);letter-spacing:-.01em;color:rgb(var(--color-heading))}
.lu-howto__steps h3 a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lu-hairline-strong)}
.lu-howto__steps h3 small{display:inline-block;margin-left:8px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--lu-honey);font:600 10px/1 var(--lu-body);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:.35em;color:var(--lu-dusk)}
.lu-howto__steps p{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary))}
.lu-howto__note{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin:28px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary))}
@media (max-width:767px){.lu-howto__steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}.lu-howto__steps li{padding:22px}}
</style>
